4
00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:13.780
Across a border, it's worse.

5
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.914
And it cuts both ways. Clients won't pay a stranger up front.

6
00:00:18.914 --> 00:00:21.940
Contractors won't start without proof the money is there.

7
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:28.010
Meridian fixes both. Locked in up front. Released on approval. Paid anywhere.

8
